      "\nRules: " + (m.channel === "text" ? "Under 300 characters. If the standard wording starts with the firm name, start with it too. " : "Short email body, 2 to 4 sentences, no subject line. ") + "Never give tax advice or mention refunds, deductions, owing, penalties or audits. Do not add numbers, dates, links or amounts that are not in the standard wording or the facts; if the standard wording has a link, keep it exactly. Do not promise outcomes. Plain friendly words, no emoji, no exclamation marks in a row. Use what we know about the client only when it helps. Answer with JSON only: {\"text\": \"...\"}";
